#: PowerDevilRunner.cpp:64
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"Lists system suspend (e.g. sleep, hibernate) options and allows them to be "
"activated"
msgstr ""
"Llista les opciones de suspensión del sistema (dormir ya ivernar) y permite "
"activales"

#: PowerDevilRunner.cpp:68
#, kde-format
msgid "Suspends the system to RAM"
msgstr "Suspende'l sistema na RAM"

#: PowerDevilRunner.cpp:72
#, kde-format
msgid "Suspends the system to disk"
msgstr "Suspende'l sistema nel discu"

#: PowerDevilRunner.cpp:75
#, kde-format
msgctxt "Note this is a KRunner keyword"
msgid "screen brightness"
msgstr "brillu de pantalla"

#: PowerDevilRunner.cpp:77
#, no-c-format, kde-format
msgid ""
"Lists screen brightness options or sets it to the brightness defined by :q:; "
"e.g. screen brightness 50 would dim the screen to 50% maximum brightness"
msgstr ""
"Llista les opciones de brillu de la pantalla o afíta'l nivel definíu por :"
"q:;, por exemplu «brillu de pantalla al 50» va facer que la pantalla "
"s'amatague un 50% del brillu máximu"

